              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Yakob, “Kikoŋ mono neni kaŋ.” Aŋun, abu Esau kikoŋ neni a Yakob, ido inak apolou ŋina araakar iŋes ekiyae neni a Yakob. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.33",
